{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1772650851,"nonce":"tDP1ApCTopSuVdJpsvyT9AIXFjY=","title":"Auth requests: validate CWD is the integration branch worktree for the repo","message":"When submitting an auth request with a CWD, Mandible should verify:\n1. CWD is a git repo\n2. Determine integration branch for that repo (develop if it exists, else main)\n3. Verify CWDs HEAD is the integration branch worktree (not a feature worktree)\n4. Reject with clear error if not — with an override flag for exceptional cases\n\nMandible already tracks repos — should leverage that to know each repos integration branch.\n\nMigrated from dotfiles issue 7dd3ebe.","files":null}]}